  face actually begin to crack under the  power of ichika's grip and for a  relatively young woman she definitely  has an extremely menacing aura i mean i  guess that's expected of yami's sister  but do you then explains that if fasta  wants to get stronger he has to be  trained by the seven and uzen which  includes ichika but ichika warns asta  that even though ryu seems to be looking  out for him she hates outsiders and men  like him so she is not at all too  pleased to be the one who has to train  him and on that insane note the reveal  of yami's badass and ominous little  sister this chapter comes to an end we  still don't know why or how asta was  teleported here or how you knew about it  and we also don't know how he knew about  what happened to asta before he was even  teleported if i had to guess i would say  that ryu has some sort of really  advanced key control that allows him to  anticipate future events and maybe even  read the key of others in order to  determine what they are thinking and  what they just experienced after all ki  is one of the most underexplored  concepts in black clover and it is a  concept that has been associated with  yami and hino country so it makes sense  that this concept would finally be fully  developed right now i look forward to  meeting the rest of the seven rusen and  to learning more about how key works if  i know my japanese and i definitely do  not ryuzen could mean peaceful dragon  although it could be translated to mean  a bunch of other things as well because  it is japanese but if the seven rusen  means the seven peaceful dragons then  this could hint at the fact that hino is  a fundamentally peaceful country and  their shogun ryu certainly seems like a  peaceful guy that said the fact that  there is a shogun also suggests that  there is also an emperor just like in  the clover kingdom power is shared  between the wizard king and the regular  king in japanese history the shogun was  a military leader who was appoin